01:06:08.040 --> 01:06:13.920
I may now have the means of helping your supreme command to defeat them, but I am again going to need your help, Mark, this one last time.

01:06:14.130 --> 01:06:17.910
I've been no help to anybody. Eve, why don't you find somebody else?

01:06:17.910 --> 01:06:24.590
This is no time for self-pity. At this moment, Professor Embry is at the airport, but unless something is done, his plane will never leave the ground.

01:06:25.080 --> 01:06:26.440
Colonel Andrews, we're in position.

01:06:26.680 --> 01:06:27.320
Andrews again?

01:06:27.830 --> 01:06:29.970
Actually, a biogenetic simulation of...

01:06:31.080 --> 01:06:33.440
By the aliens, Bruce was destroyed,

01:06:33.620 --> 01:06:36.160
