01:06:50.890 --> 01:06:53.530
but if my plan fails, Professor Embry is our last hope.

01:06:53.690 --> 01:06:55.110
That's why you must go to the airport.

01:06:55.190 --> 01:06:56.630
Okay, okay, I get the picture.

01:07:30.740 --> 01:07:32.280
It just started happening.

01:07:32.680 --> 01:07:33.960
Well, find out who's responsible.

01:07:34.640 --> 01:07:37.930
Sir, it's the EVE, sir.

01:07:38.090 --> 01:07:40.670
