01:07:54.520 --> 01:07:55.540
Sir, I don't like it.

01:07:55.620 --> 01:07:57.700
There's a very good chance it's another alien trick.

01:07:58.820 --> 01:07:59.120
No.

01:08:09.280 --> 01:08:11.420
I certainly hope nothing's happened. She should be here by now.

01:08:11.580 --> 01:08:13.220
I'm sure she'll be here any moment, sir.

01:08:13.730 --> 01:08:15.650
