01:08:17.720 --> 01:08:19.460
You give him more credit than he deserves, Professor.

01:08:19.840 --> 01:08:22.700
You'll be in DEFCOM Alaska Base before he even knows you're gone.

01:08:27.290 --> 01:08:29.870
Sir, we're receiving a communication from the alien fleet.

01:08:30.600 --> 01:08:34.140
We have come to fulfill two missions of supreme importance on your planet.

01:08:34.800 --> 01:08:36.080
One has been accomplished.

01:08:36.360 --> 01:08:41.240
The last megabytes of your EVE's memory are being fed into our databanks even as we speak.

01:08:41.660 --> 01:08:43.940
The process will be finished in a matter of minutes.

01:08:44.850 --> 01:08:45.830
I don't believe it.

01:08:46.010 --> 01:08:46.550
Don't you?

01:08:46.920 --> 01:08:48.840
Andrews was placed in command of that computer.

01:08:49.060 --> 01:08:50.360
He'd never stab us in the back.

01:08:50.630 --> 01:08:52.490
No man would ever betray his own planet.

01:08:53.100 --> 01:08:56.040
No man, perhaps, but the person you refer to is not a man.

01:08:56.320 --> 01:08:58.200
He is a biogenetic simulant.

01:08:58.820 --> 01:08:59.960
Unhampered by any such...

01:09:00.220 --> 01:09:05.800
of loyalty well then what more do you want you have what you came for is there some other purpose

01:09:05.800 --> 01:09:10.600
for you remaining in orbit above our planet you mentioned a second reason for coming here

01:09:10.600 --> 01:09:18.460
we remember the armada you did revenge so that's what you want earth man we've come to bury you

01:09:23.120 --> 01:09:29.970
fleets in position sir better for your replacements are back in we got

