01:11:27.320 --> 01:11:29.120
Wherever you are, I can sure use your help, old buddy.

01:11:30.410 --> 01:11:32.910
Lock up that ship. Divert all power from its boosters.

01:11:33.090 --> 01:11:33.370
Yes, sir.

01:11:33.530 --> 01:11:38.340
You've never seen a control panel like this before.

01:11:39.170 --> 01:11:41.070
